      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 2194771437,
          "type": null,
          "body": "According to https://protobuf.dev/programming-guides/json/ mentioned, when Protobuf is mapped to JSON, the enum value should default to use the name of enum value, but if it is not defined, it should be able to be replaced with the integer value.\n\n![protobuf_json_map](/uploads/f0e498d6c619b4a359d03fcba5cd8429/protobuf_json_map.png)",
